This skill was rewritten in 2026 for a different set of image models (Seedream 4.5,
Grok Imagine, Gemini 3). Parts of it still derive from the original `smixs/visual-skills`
skill and remain under its MIT licence, reproduced below:

  - references/creative-direction.md   (carried over substantially unchanged)
  - references/patterns/*              (creative substance retained; prompt format and
                                        model recommendations rewritten)

The rest — SKILL.md, references/seedream.md, references/gemini.md, references/grok.md and
references/editing.md — is original work and not derived from the upstream skill.

